OL,3,ADisgraced ex-Reform Wales leader who
OL,4,Atook pro-Russian bribes must pay #22k
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former leader of Reform UK in Wales
OL,7,Fhas been ordered to pay more than
OL,8,F#22,500 after accepting bribes to make
OL,9,Fpro-Russian speeches in the European
OL,10,FParliament.
OL,12,FGill, 53, of Llangefni on Anglesey, was
OL,13,Fsentenced to 10-and-a-half years in
OL,14,Fprison in November 2025 after pleading
OL,15,Fguilty to eight counts of bribery under
OL,16,Fthe Bribery Act 2010.
OL,18,FHe is thought to have received up to
OL,19,F#40,000 to help pro-Russian politicians
OL,20,Fin Ukraine, while he was a Member of
OL,21,Fthe European Parliament (MEP).
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
