OL,3,ADisgraced ex-Reform Wales leader who
OL,4,Atook pro-Russian bribes must pay #22k
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the Old Bailey on Thursday he was
OL,7,Fgiven six months to sell a rental
OL,8,Fproperty to pay the money to the UK
OL,9,Fgovernment, or face a further nine
OL,10,Fmonths in prison.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
